WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
There's some big border drama

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:03.086
happening in South America right now.

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:04.004
The government of Venezuela

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.046
just had this ceremony

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.631
where they released this new map.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:08.008
The map claims

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.426
all of this land;

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:11.469
land which is a part of the sovereign

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:12.512
country of Guyana.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.097
Like they're claiming well over

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.724
half of Guyana's territory.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.017
What is going on here?

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.435
Well, there are two answers.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.562
The first one is the British.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.354
Back in 1899,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.272
the British and Venezuela

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.732
agreed on this border.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:24.607
But Venezuela now

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.694
says that that was a biased decision

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.528
and that it was actually

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.613
just colonial shenanigans by the U.S.

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:31.364
and the U.K.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.949
And that actually this is their land.

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.826
But the real answer here is oil.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:35.702
In 2015,

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.579
they discovered a massive oil deposit

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:39.122
right off of the coast of Guyana.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.206
They're making $1 billion

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.166
a year off this.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.792
Venezuela wants this oil

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.085
and they think they have a claim

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:45.045
to all of this land.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.421
And so they're going to fight for it.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:46.838
Guyana,

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.631
obviously is not letting this happen.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:49.507
They're going to fight about it.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.467
It's going to be a thing.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.593
I'm going to keep following it.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.343
If you want to better understand

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:54.179
global politics, follow along for more.

